#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:5
msgid "Column"
msgstr "列"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:8
msgid "Definition"
msgstr "定义"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:10
msgid ""
"A column of `cells`_ from the `title block`_ is a group of `cells`_ that are"
" placed one over the other."
msgstr ""
"`图框 <title block_>`_ 中由 `单元格 <cells_>`_ 组成的一列，是一组上下叠放的 `单元格 <cells_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:13
msgid "Properties"
msgstr "属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:15
msgid ""
"At QElectroTech, a column from the `title block`_ has only one property, the"
" width of the `cells`_ that are part of the columns."
msgstr ""
"在 QElectroTech 中，`图框 <title block_>`_ 的一列只有一个属性，即属于该列的 `单元格 <cells_>`_ 宽度。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:18
msgid "To display the column width:"
msgstr "显示列宽："

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:20
msgid "Double click on the column head."
msgstr "双击列标题。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:25
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block column width property"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框列宽属性"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:27
msgid ""
"QElectroTech works with pixels, the width is defined according pixel unit."
msgstr "QElectroTech 以像素为单位工作，宽度按像素单位定义。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:29
msgid "Unlike rows, the width of a column can be defined as:"
msgstr "与行不同，一列的宽度可以定义为："

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:31
msgid "Absolute value, pixel units."
msgstr "绝对值，以像素为单位。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:32
msgid ""
"Relative value to total, percent of the total width of the `title block`_."
msgstr "相对于总值的相对值，即占 `图框 <title block_>`_ 总宽度的百分比。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/elements/column.rst:33
msgid ""
"Relative value to remaining, percent of the remaining width of the `title "
"block`_."
msgstr "相对于剩余值的相对值，即占 `图框 <title block_>`_ 剩余宽度的百分比。"
